cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the JBI article and this repository archive."
title: "Reproduction package for: Medical Term Embedding for MedDRA Multi-Parent DAG - A Heterogeneous Graph Approach with Multi-Level Contrastive Learning"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code and experimental artefacts for a manuscript submitted to the
  Journal of Biomedical Informatics (JBI). The method embeds MedDRA terms by combining
  term-name semantics (PubMedBERT) with the five-level multi-parent hierarchy, using a
  heterogeneous graph encoder and a multi-level weighted contrastive loss with
  positive-negative mutual exclusion. MedDRA source data are not redistributed;
  a synthetic demo dataset is provided for licence-free verification of the code path.
